      "description": "This prop was made as an assignment for my Digital Sculpting course at DAE Howest. It will be part of a small diorama. I chose to create a wizard's living room setting. \nIt was sculpted and then polypainted in ZBrush.\n\nI created the concept by mix and matching a few other concept, but mainly based myself off of Merlin's chair in the sword in the stone, and this concept by Cory Loftis.\nhttps:\/\/carbonmade-media.accelerator.net\/21299402;366x441.jpeg\n\nYou can also check it out on my artstation, where I show some renders made in ZBrush: https:\/\/www.artstation.com\/artwork\/mDE2ke",
